--- WHAM_files (US) ---

Same WHAM scripts as LFER_3_mg2/pph4/PMF_react_TS1/WHAM_files/ (wham1D.py,
errors_wham1D.py, job_wham.sh), shared by the three TS-TS umbrella-sampling reconstructions
in USW_100_TS1_TS2/, USW_100_TS1_TS3/, USW_100_TS2_TS3/. See that folder's README for what
each script does.

Note: this README documents pre-existing content; no existing file was modified.
